 "notes": "The viewport 64.5 x 14.0 is the bezel opening; the case window must not clip it (view_zone). ASSUMPTIONS and uncertainty: bezel outline 71.2 x 24.2 (+/-0.5, some modules 72 x 25); viewport and active area assumed centred on the PCB (real offsets up to ~1.5 mm toward the header side); PCB 1.6 (+/-0.1); overall height 13 is from the datasheet 'about', module variants with LED backlight run 11.5 to 14. Header position assumed (+/-2 mm in X), PINS is a through-hole 16-pin row on the +Y edge with the header body not modelled. Import gate: bounding box 80 x 36 x 13; hole pattern 75 x 31; viewport inside the bezel.",
